{"id":"99b118717f09b9db","group":"16","path":"16/16-prop-quotient-fibration.md","title":"prop-quotient-fibration","display":"prop-quotient-fibration","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-prop-quotient-fibration","aliases":["16-prop-quotient-fibration","16-pro--quotient-fibration"],"display":"prop-quotient-fibration","depends_on":["[[16-df-quotient-type]]"],"source":"Lemma4.8.2(i) pp.292–293 (PDF312–313)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-prop-quotient-fibration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-prop-quotient-fibration</span><span>16-pro--quotient-fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-quotient-fibration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e29c92ba515d8b86\" href=\"?note=e29c92ba515d8b86\" title=\"16-df-quotient-type\">16-df-quotient-type</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Lemma4.8.2(i) pp.292–293 (PDF312–313)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为 Eq-fibration，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotType}\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotType}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Quot}_p\">\\(\\mathsf{Quot}_p\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e29c92ba515d8b86\" href=\"?note=e29c92ba515d8b86\" title=\"16-df-quotient-type\">16-df-quotient-type</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:I\\to Q\">\\(q:I\\to Q\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotType}(p)\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times I})\n(\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\exists q\\in\\mathcal B(I,Q))\\ \\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QuotType}(p)\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times I})\n(\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\exists q\\in\\mathcal B(I,Q))\\ \\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u,v\\in\\mathcal B(Q,J))\\ (uq=vq\\Rightarrow u=v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u,v\\in\\mathcal B(Q,J))\\ (uq=vq\\Rightarrow u=v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式展开定义。第二式是 Lemma4.8.2(i) p.292 (PDF312)：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"uq=vq=w\">\\(uq=vq=w\\)</span>，二者都是由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 的泛性质给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 的唯一因子，所以相等。原稿的纤维商结论随对象层纠正。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-quotient-type","status":"resolved","id":"e29c92ba515d8b86","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-quotient-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-quotient-type","status":"resolved","id":"e29c92ba515d8b86","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为 Eq-fibration，$\\mathrm{QuotType}$、$\\mathsf{Quot}_p$ 使用 [[16-df-quotient-type]]；$I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$、$R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}$、$q:I\\to Q$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuotType}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Quot}_p","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}","display":false},{"tex":"q:I\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuotType}(p)\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times I})\n(\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\exists q\\in\\mathcal B(I,Q))\\ \\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u,v\\in\\mathcal B(Q,J))\\ (uq=vq\\Rightarrow u=v).","display":true},{"tex":"uq=vq=w","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false}],"bytes":1228,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-398","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-prop-quotient-fibration|prop-quotient-fibration]]"}],"outgoing":["e29c92ba515d8b86"]}